  <item>
    <title>Vol.3 我的猫不爱我！养猫聊天局速进～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662e57cf5fb33c1b2b288eb7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662e57cf5fb33c1b2b288eb7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Apr 2024 14:06:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天邀请了两位养猫的朋友瑶瑶（@瑶瑶_Yao）和土豆（壮壮_VIDZ），和大家聊一聊“养猫那些事儿”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>猫咪可爱而神秘，有猫是有趣且治愈的事儿，养猫则是一件说简单也复杂的事。我们为什么养猫？养猫人有哪些幸福时刻和崩溃时刻？如何伺候好猫咪的吃喝玩乐？和你们一起分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻 你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:00:36</a> 三人养7猫：嗅嗅、卡卡、果酱、小晕、松花、小猫、秋秋；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">00:05:17</a> 当年领养我家猫还要填户籍、身份证号、人均住房面积；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">00:11:12</a> 你们和猫咪是什么关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">00:14:50</a> 每个月给猫咪花多少钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">00:18:08</a> 关于宠物保险；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">00:26:30</a> 养猫之后，感觉家里不再是孤零零一个人了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">00:30:35</a> 猫咪需要社会化训练吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">00:35:36</a> 养猫交过哪些智商税？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">00:39:44</a> 养第三只猫后，我一年不敢告诉家里；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3131">00:52:11</a> 同居养猫是「养娃代餐」吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3402">00:56:42</a> 给想要养猫的人的建议。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>猫说 - 黑屋乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔍 收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>目前《尤其此刻》在：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客｜小宇宙｜QQ音乐 ｜网易云音乐 ｜ 喜马拉雅 ｜ 蜻蜓FM</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnojvdxImFj9qnqVZGZ9cbQmbh4p.m4a" length="57798994" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flhzq-PwaoTnJe_pT-247vGPNoY0.png"/>
